######## 60. Hooks

(hook) bash cp .env.example .env
DENY: kagebunshin: $T/work/api/.env is in project api, whose secrets come from kagebunshin, so writing a .env file there is refused. Run the command that needs the secrets as `kagebunshin run -- COMMAND` instead; to add or change a secret, ask the human.

(hook) bash echo "A=1" > .env
DENY: kagebunshin: $T/work/api/.env is in project api, whose secrets come from kagebunshin, so writing a .env file there is refused. Run the command that needs the secrets as `kagebunshin run -- COMMAND` instead; to add or change a secret, ask the human.

